00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:58.630
<b>Back in the day, demons and other dangerous creatures were rampant in Flonyard.</b>

00:01:59.090 --> 00:02:05.890
<b>We humans kept to ourselves in order to not disturb them.</b>

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:04.100
<b>Memoirs of a Hero and a Princess</b>

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:04.100
<b>Memoirs of a Hero and a Princess</b>

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:04.100
<b>Memoirs of a Hero and a Princess</b>

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:11.730
<b>However, there was one person who wanted to change that.</b>

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:14.190
<b>She was the princess of the <i>Kingdom</i> of Pastillage;</b>

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:16.230
<b>its last Queen, and Hero Princess, Clarifie.</b>

00:02:16.230 --> 00:02:17.360
<b>We called her Fie.</b>

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:24.160
<b>The Hero that she summoned was the daughter of a French noble</b>

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:26.450
<b>who had been displaced to the middle of nowhere.</b>

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:29.120
<b>That was me, of course.</b>

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:46.640
<b>I was quite surprised and confused.</b>

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:49.640
<b>You must be Adeleide-sama, our hero.</b>

00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:01.240
<b>I must thank you for coming.</b>

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:05.530
<b>My name is Clarifie.</b>

00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:07.410
<b>I am the lord of the Kingdom of Pastillage.</b>

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:17.840
<b>She then took me to her castle.</b>

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:23.590
<b>There are many demons that live beyond our walls,</b>

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:26.930
<b>and my people are constantly living in fear.</b>

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:30.980
<b>Because the trade routes are not safe,</b>

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:35.860
<b>we have little trade between nations.</b>

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:40.740
<b>I want to make this a better, safer world for my people!</b>

00:03:43.150 --> 00:03:45.620
<b>I want to organize a large-scale demon eradication</b>

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:48.200
<b>and extend my kingdom's horizons!</b>

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:55.210
<b>But of course, I cannot ask too much of my civilians and soldiers.</b>

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:58.790
<b>That is why I have decided to do it myself!</b>

00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:00.880
<b>But you're the princess!</b>

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:02.550
<b>I know!</b>

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:05.640
<b>And I would like you to accompany me, my hero!</b>

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:10.100
<b>I've never fought a demon before,</b>

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:12.350
<b>so I'm afraid I wouldn't be of any use...</b>

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:14.390
<b>That's no problem!</b>

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:18.650
<b>This is the Grand-Mars, Pastillage's sacred weapon!</b>

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:22.610
<b>You, our hero, are destined to wield it!</b>

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:41.250
<b>I haven't a clue about how it works,</b>

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:42.920
<b>but this gun is incredible.</b>

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:46.130
<b>Let's make sure we're equipped for the worst!</b>

00:04:46.130 --> 00:04:47.300
<b>R-Right!</b>

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:52.220
<b>This armor should protect you from just about anything.</b>

00:04:58.310 --> 00:05:01.150
<b>I-I kinda like it.</b>

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:06.320
<b>Let's investigate near the castle first.</b>

00:05:10.070 --> 00:05:10.870
<b>Fie.</b>

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:12.950
<b>Are you sure about this?</b>

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:14.870
<b>Valery...</b>

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:16.330
<b>Yes, I am.</b>

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:18.460
<b>I thought I made it clear.</b>

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:20.750
<b>You're not cut out for demon slaying.</b>

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:23.050
<b>I understand that.</b>

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:27.010
<b>But this is what I want to do.</b>

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:36.100
<b>Do you know Valery, Hero-sama?</b>

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:40.020
<b>He peeped on me in the bath on my first night here!</b>

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:42.020
<b>Quit making things up!</b>

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:45.610
<b>You were in there during <i>my</i> bathing time!</b>

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:47.610
<b>Who is he, anyway?!</b>

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:49.860
<b>He's my younger brother.</b>

00:05:49.860 --> 00:05:51.030
<b>Our first prince...</b>

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:52.030
<b>Wha—</b>

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:54.490
<b>This is our hero, Valery.</b>

00:05:54.490 --> 00:05:56.700
<b>Our <i>hero</i>, eh?</b>

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:03.420
<b>Look after my sister, okay?</b>

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:09.010
<b>And don't push it if you think you're in trouble.</b>

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:12.890
<b><i>Thus began my journey with the princess.</i></b>

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:17.480
<b><i>Fie-sama and the hero Adele set off with the whole world to explore...</i></b>

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:25.190
<b>Those things are demons!</b>

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:27.780
<b>They're quite cute.</b>

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.790
<b>My clothes!</b>

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:42.460
<b>It's thanks to the protective magic!</b>

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:44.540
<b>We can't let them dissolve it all!</b>

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:47.510
<b>Let's fight back!</b>

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:49.840
<b>Spirit Spell: Ruby Flare!</b>

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:17.160
<b>Yes!</b>

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:22.290
<b>Now that we have new equipment,</b>

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:24.330
<b>it's time to head north!</b>

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:26.090
<b>Yes, Princess!</b>

00:07:35.590 --> 00:07:36.970
<b>Why, you...</b>

00:07:51.190 --> 00:07:52.400
<b>We've won!</b>

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:53.450
<b>Yes!</b>

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:57.580
<b><i>And so, after a good helping of close calls,</i></b>

00:07:57.580 --> 00:08:00.450
<b><i>we started getting used to fighting demons</i></b>

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:04.960
<b><i>and tried our hands at some more powerful ones.</i></b>

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:12.170
<b>What a powerful demon.</b>

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:14.550
<b>We can't let it get past us!</b>

00:08:37.110 --> 00:08:38.070
<b>Hina!</b>

00:08:38.070 --> 00:08:38.990
<b>You get the demon!</b>

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:41.290
<b>Got it, Brother!</b>

00:09:09.310 --> 00:09:10.650
<b>Evil spirit, begone!</b>

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:22.620
<b>Good work, Hina.</b>

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:23.910
<b>Thanks.</b>

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:26.120
<b>Are you two okay?</b>

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:28.120
<b>Who are you?</b>

00:09:28.120 --> 00:09:30.380
<b>Just some passers-by.</b>

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:32.800
<b>With a knack for fighting.</b>

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:43.140
<b>We're on a journey in search of some swords.</b>

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:44.520
<b>You saw one just now.</b>

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:49.140
<b>They're called cursed swords, and the one that was impaled in the mole deity was one of them.</b>

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:53.400
<b>Animals and deities turn into demons when they touch one of them.</b>

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:58.650
<b>Our quest is to find them and seal them.</b>

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:04.660
<b>It saves the lives of the animals and deities that the cursed swords have possessed.</b>

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:06.120
<b>Perhaps...</b>

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:10.170
<b>you could meet with my younger brother?</b>

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:14.340
<b>Cursed swords?</b>

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:15.920
<b>I know about those.</b>

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:18.470
<b>I know where most of them are.</b>

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:19.550
<b>Good to hear.</b>

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:23.430
<b>I'm interested in the history of this world and the demons.</b>

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:24.760
<b>And you?</b>

00:10:24.760 --> 00:10:27.060
<b>You're trying to kill them all?</b>

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:32.020
<b>I just want to collect cursed swords.</b>

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:35.820
<b>There are many people in this world who are being attacked by demons.</b>

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:39.320
<b>All I want to do is help those people.</b>

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:42.660
<b>Just speaking hypothetically...</b>

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:45.160
<b>We've been threatened by demons all these years,</b>

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:48.290
<b>and there hasn't been much going on between nations.</b>

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:52.080
<b>We haven't got the time to fight amongst ourselves.</b>

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:58.460
<b>But once the demons are gone and we're living in peace, what happens?</b>

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:02.180
<b>We'll start picking fights with each other.</b>

00:11:02.590 --> 00:11:06.430
<b>Peaceful lands, fertile lands, central roads...</b>

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:09.350
<b>Those are what we'll be fighting over.</b>

00:11:09.930 --> 00:11:13.850
<b>That's why I think we're fine as we are now.</b>

00:11:14.560 --> 00:11:19.360
<b>There's no harm in keeping just your close ones safe.</b>

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:22.530
<b>That's one way to think about it.</b>

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:28.120
<b>It is a king's job to keep his people from fighting.</b>

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:33.250
<b>That won't stop us from collecting cursed swords!</b>

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:38.420
<b>And since Fie and Adele want to slay demons,</b>

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:40.970
<b>we should definitely travel together.</b>

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:48.310
<b>So we need you, Valery, to tell us more about demons and cursed swords.</b>

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:52.270
<b>Would you look at this dense little kid?</b>

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:54.400
<b>I'm not some kid! I'm <i>Hina!</i></b>

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:56.650
<b>Did you even hear what I just said?</b>

00:11:56.650 --> 00:11:58.270
<b>I did!</b>

00:11:58.270 --> 00:12:00.690
<b>Won't you come with us, Valery?</b>

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:02.400
<b>No.</b>

00:12:03.150 --> 00:12:05.660
<b>I'm against traveling together.</b>

00:12:08.280 --> 00:12:11.660
<b>Hina and I lost our home to a demon,</b>

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:15.750
<b>and we were drenched in its blood when we killed it.</b>

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:17.290
<b>Because of that,</b>

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:20.420
<b>Hina and I became immortal.</b>

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:24.340
<b>Hina hasn't grown an inch since.</b>

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:27.180
<b>Not <i>yet.</i></b>

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:30.430
<b>There's too much we don't know about demons,</b>

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:32.680
<b>and that means there's unforeseeable danger out there.</b>

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:38.440
<b>Are you two sure that you want to keep fighting demons?</b>

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:44.450
<b>Yes.</b>

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:47.610
<b>I want to slay demons and expand our horizons.</b>

00:12:47.610 --> 00:12:50.740
<b>I want to bring a smile to everyone!</b>

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:52.160
<b>Adele?</b>

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:53.620
<b>I...</b>

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:57.540
<b>I know nothing about the world or demons.</b>

00:12:57.540 --> 00:13:01.590
<b>But I know that I love the people who live here.</b>

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:07.970
<b>And I love Fie-sama, my princess, the one who brought me here.</b>

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:11.720
<b>I want to help Fie-sama make her dream come true.</b>

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:13.470
<b>I want to be...</b>

00:13:14.680 --> 00:13:16.480
<b>Fie-sama's gun.</b>

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:20.310
<b>So I will do whatever she decides to do.</b>

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:23.230
<b>My hero...</b>

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:28.950
<b>Of course, that doesn't mean I won't stop you from making foolish decisions.</b>

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:30.450
<b>Okay!</b>

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:32.530
<b>You heard them.</b>

00:13:32.530 --> 00:13:34.080
<b>What do you say, Valery?</b>

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:38.250
<b>You think I can say no after that, kiddo?</b>

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:39.750
<b>It's <i>Hina!</i></b>

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:43.500
<b><i>Thus, the five of us set off...</i></b>

00:13:44.000 --> 00:13:47.630
<b><i>Isuka, a wandering swordsmith and demon-banishing wizard;</i></b>

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:48.760
<b><i>Hina, a swordsman;</i></b>

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:50.760
<b><i>Demonologist, Valery;</i></b>

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:52.510
<b><i>Fie, a princess;</i></b>

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:55.770
<b><i>and Adele, the hero.</i></b>

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:09.610
<b><i>We opened up roads between communities.</i></b>

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:13.660
<b><i>We saved nations under attack by demons</i></b>

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:16.160
<b><i>and aided in their relations with their neighboring countries.</i></b>

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:20.080
<b><i>We spent many years traveling around the world</i></b>

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:24.880
<b><i>to deserts, glaciers, volcanoes, and everywhere else we could imagine.</i></b>

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:33.720
<b><i>Our bond became even stronger after defeating Kratos, the last of a family of Divinegons...</i></b>

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:40.390
<b><i>And we became more powerful as we developed my Hero Stone and Fie's Spirit Stone.</i></b>

00:14:40.890 --> 00:14:44.900
<b><i>To find the legendary demon-banishing sword,</i></b>

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:47.530
<b><i>we had to travel far, far up into the sky.</i></b>

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:51.160
<b>It's a big one!</b>

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:53.490
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:54.530
<b>Let's go, Adele!</b>

00:14:54.530 --> 00:14:56.080
<b>Got it, Valery!</b>

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:09.010
<b><i>By the time we knew it, we had become famous around the world.</i></b>

00:15:09.920 --> 00:15:15.050
<b><i>We defeated over two thousand demons, 
which sped up Valery's research immensely.</i></b>

00:15:15.050 --> 00:15:21.020
<b><i>Many of the roads were reclaimed, and nations were able to get in touch with one another.</i></b>

00:15:21.020 --> 00:15:24.690
<b><i>The people of Flonyard became much happier.</i></b>

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:30.190
<b><i>This peace </i>did<i> bring the rise of wars between nations...</i></b>

00:15:30.190 --> 00:15:33.950
<b><i>but only until our princess founded a particular organization.</i></b>

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:38.330
<b><i>This was the Continental Treaties Organization,</i></b>

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:40.200
<b><i>which would set rules on international conflicts.</i></b>

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:46.210
<b>It's the symbol of peace in Flonyard that we still maintain today.</b>

00:15:46.790 --> 00:15:48.840
<b>What a great story!</b>

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:53.220
<b>I'd never heard that about my predecessors before.</b>

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:59.220
<b>That was about when Valery the
demonologist stopped showing up in public.</b>

00:15:59.220 --> 00:16:01.480
<b>Why was that, if I may ask?</b>

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:05.350
<b>Research isn't something I can just quit cold turkey.</b>

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:10.610
<b><i>I had to maintain a lot of live demons and samples for my research.</i></b>

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:16.870
<b><i>Because of that, I figured I might as well stay in the basement and call myself the "Demon King."</i></b>

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:22.870
<b><i>It started out as a joke, but I guess I couldn't stop myself...</i></b>

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:30.130
<b><i>I pushed around the guys that came to challenge this "Demon King,"</i></b>

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:37.840
<b><i>and I went around teaching lessons to some lords that had forgotten about demons entirely.</i></b>

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:49.400
<b>And with his help, my body was able to... develop a little more.</b>

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:51.070
<b>Cool.</b>

00:16:51.480 --> 00:16:52.400
<b>However...</b>

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:54.610
<b>even when the world found peace,</b>

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:58.160
<b>Fie never stopped searching for Demons.</b>

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:02.620
<b>We should stop searching for demons now.</b>

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:06.420
<b>You already have so much to do as a king.</b>

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:10.460
<b>You've been leaving all of your duties in my hands lately!</b>

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:13.420
<b>That's how it should be.</b>

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:16.510
<b>Should something ever happen to me,</b>

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:19.680
<b>I want <i>you</i> to look after Pastillage.</b>

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:21.680
<b>That's not something a king should—</b>

00:17:23.470 --> 00:17:25.390
<b>I brought you here without your permission,</b>

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:29.520
<b>and there's no way to take you back.</b>

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:33.440
<b>That's been haunting me this whole time.</b>

00:17:35.940 --> 00:17:37.900
<b>I've told you already...</b>

00:17:37.900 --> 00:17:40.320
<b>Back at home, nobody would miss me,</b>

00:17:40.320 --> 00:17:43.330
<b>nor need my help for anything.</b>

00:17:44.240 --> 00:17:48.710
<b>Now that I'm here with you, I couldn't be happier!</b>

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:51.340
<b>I was able to help people.</b>

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:53.460
<b>They even called me a hero!</b>

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:56.470
<b>They all smiled at me...</b>

00:17:57.220 --> 00:17:59.840
<b>All because you brought me here!</b>

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:05.970
<b>It's because you were brave enough to fight by my side.</b>

00:18:05.970 --> 00:18:08.770
<b>When you said that you would be my gun...</b>

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:10.690
<b>I was so happy!</b>

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:14.520
<b>But from now on...</b>

00:18:14.520 --> 00:18:18.740
<b>I just want you to live your own life.</b>

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:22.160
<b><i>I had anticipated it for quite some time...</i></b>

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:27.250
<b><i>Due to Fie using Spirit and healing spells,</i></b>

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:30.250
<b><i>she was highly susceptible to the demons' miasma.</i></b>

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:37.550
<b><i>The next morning, she left the castle as usual...</i></b>

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:40.760
<b><i>and after two whole weeks,</i></b>

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:43.760
<b><i>she came back in terrible shape.</i></b>

00:18:48.850 --> 00:18:51.770
<b>I'm back...</b>

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:55.020
<b><i>She had traveled far to Northern Villand.</i></b>

00:18:55.020 --> 00:18:58.610
<b><i>to defeat the Toxic Dragon of the Ice Wall, a demon possessed by a cursed sword, single-handedly.</i></b>

00:18:59.190 --> 00:19:01.490
<b><i>She was unable to leave her bed after that.</i></b>

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:10.540
<b><i>Valery was the one who told me that Fie knew her death was close.</i></b>

00:19:17.300 --> 00:19:22.300
<b>I wouldn't have lived much longer had I stayed here the whole time.</b>

00:19:23.090 --> 00:19:28.520
<b>I wanted to move on toward the world that I dreamed of</b>

00:19:29.220 --> 00:19:33.310
<b>instead of living an empty life by throwing away my quest.</b>

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:38.230
<b>My dreams had truly become a reality,
and our horizons are much, much wider.</b>

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:43.240
<b>I paved the way toward a more peaceful world.</b>

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:47.620
<b>I have no regrets, you know...</b>

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:51.830
<b>I couldn't be happier.</b>

00:19:55.580 --> 00:20:04.010
<b><i>Soon after, Clarifie Eins Pastillage reached the end of her journey,</i></b>

00:20:05.050 --> 00:20:07.600
<b><i>forever to be remembered as the Hero Princess.</i></b>

00:20:09.510 --> 00:20:13.850
<b><i>Pastillage was no longer a kingdom, but a principality</i></b>

00:20:14.600 --> 00:20:19.360
<b>and Valery and I began to live hidden from the people.</b>

00:20:20.230 --> 00:20:22.860
<b>We saw our children grow up and move on with their own lives,</b>

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:25.360
<b>and saw the faces of our grandchildren.</b>

00:20:25.860 --> 00:20:29.990
<b><i>That was when we decided to rest with Fie.</i></b>

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:34.870
<b><i>Isuka and Hina continued their journey...</i></b>

00:20:36.460 --> 00:20:38.630
<b><i>and I met Yukikaze,</i></b>

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:43.510
<b><i>soon after my brother and I decided to travel separately.</i></b>

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:55.140
<b><i>And after Shinku and Couvre woke us from our slumber...</i></b>

00:20:55.140 --> 00:20:56.600
<b><i>That's where we are now.</i></b>

00:20:57.350 --> 00:21:02.110
<b><i>We couldn't be happier to see our descendants living happily in a peaceful world,</i></b>

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:06.110
<b><i>and I'm sure Fie thinks the same.</i></b>

00:21:06.740 --> 00:21:10.620
<b>But that doesn't mean it'll last forever.</b>

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:16.120
<b>A hero won't just pop out of nowhere to save you.</b>

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:19.830
<b>Always remember that, okay?</b>

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:21.800
<b>Yes!</b>

00:21:22.710 --> 00:21:25.760
<b>My, that was quite a long story.</b>

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:27.430
<b>Shall we take a break?</b>

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:29.220
<b>I'll go get some more tea.</b>

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:31.560
<b>Hello!</b>

00:21:31.560 --> 00:21:33.430
<b>Sorry we're late!</b>

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:37.390
<b>Wait, did you guys just...</b>

00:21:37.390 --> 00:21:39.400
<b>We <i>just</i> finished!</b>

00:21:39.400 --> 00:21:41.310
<b>You guys were way too late!</b>

00:21:41.310 --> 00:21:46.820
<b>Well, I've told these three most of the story before.</b>

00:21:46.820 --> 00:21:48.660
<b>I wish I could've heard it again.</b>

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:53.080
<b><i>Our heroes and lords are all living happily.</i></b>

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:58.040
<b><i>Please keep watching over them, Fie.</i></b>

